# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS 无 whoami → CMake 构建信息注入 STRIP 崩溃 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-16
# Software: libcec 8.1.7 (Pulse-Eight/libcec)
# Gate: 手动构建 + conan create + W3 本地 CI 全通过（.ci-result.json exit_code=0）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2130
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan|make
phase:                  configuration|cmake_configure|conan_verify
error_signature:        string sub-command STRIP requires two arguments|SetBuildInfo\.cmake|
                         whoami|BUILD_USER|execute_process\(COMMAND.*whoami|配置不完整.*errors occurred
severity:               2
category:               platform, build-system, cmake, configure, toolchain
match_keywords:         whoami, STRIP, SetBuildInfo.cmake, BUILD_USER, DISABLE_BUILDINFO,
                         buildinfo, string STRIP, requires two arguments, OHOS, cmake configure,
                         构建信息, whoami 缺失, 可复现构建, reproducible build, git revision,
                         SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, 编译信息注入
title:                  OHOS 无 whoami：CMake 上游构建信息注入（SetBuildInfo.cmake 模式）
                        报 "string sub-command STRIP requires two arguments" ——
                        用官方 DISABLE_BUILDINFO=ON 关闭，而非打补丁

root_cause: >
  libcec 上游在 SetBuildInfo.cmake 非 Windows 分支中：
  `find_program(WHOAMI_BIN whoami ...)` + `execute_process(COMMAND "${WHOAMI_BIN}"
  OUTPUT_VARIABLE BUILD_USER)` + `string(STRIP ${BUILD_USER} BUILD_USER)`。OHOS 无
  whoami（command -v whoami → exit 127），BUILD_USER 未定义/为空，`string(STRIP ...)`
  参数不足，CMake 报 "string sub-command STRIP requires two arguments" 并使 configure
  失败（"Configuring incomplete, errors occurred!"）。同一模式也会波及 hostname/git
  revision 注入块。

affected_scope:         所有在 configure 阶段注入 whoami/hostname/git 构建信息的 CMake 项目
                        （SetBuildInfo.cmake 模式及其同类），OHOS 平台跨库通用。
verification_cmd:       无 DISABLE_BUILDINFO 时 cmake configure 必失败（string(STRIP) 报错）；
                        加 -DDISABLE_BUILDINFO=ON 后 configure 成功、conan create 与 W3 通过
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           disable-buildinfo-injection
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
last_updated:               2026-10-17
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E2130.md
rec_description:        disable-buildinfo-injection
